# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha 9617e25890fcfbe6; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-WEB-14
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: 9617e25890fcfbe6
doc: Settings, Remote access offers the switch that serves this desktop to browsers (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Remote access offers Serve this desktop to browsers, the switch of the listener
not-covered: off by default and port 8443 unless chosen
not-covered: HTTPS only and the watcher thread that follows the setting every two seconds
not-covered: a persisted setting across a restart
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Remote access
click-sidebar Remote access
wait app=Settings page="Remote access"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Serve this desktop to browsers
expect-page Remote access
